what columns does my finance assistant CSV need and what format should each one be in

AI:
Your CSV needs four columns. Date should be in any standard date format such as YYYY-MM-DD. Amount should be the dollar amount and may include a dollar sign, may have commas in large numbers, and may be negative for refunds — for example $69.99 or -$15.00. Category should be a text label describing the type of spending such as Gaming, Gym, Cinema, Tea and Café, or Refund. Description should be plain text describing the transaction such as Xbox Game Pass Ultimate 3 Months or Maison de Thé Green Tea Moka

