what are the inputs and outputs of my finbot chatbot function, it takes a user message and optionally a spending context string

AI:
The inputs are the user message as a string and an optional spending context string such as "Gaming $216.96, Gym $85.00, Cinema $35.00, Tea and Café $32.50". The system prompt is also an implicit input — it defines FinBot's personality and instructions. The output is a string of finance advice generated by the language model. If the hands-on-ai server is unavailable the fallback also takes the same inputs but routes them through the Anthropic API instead, and still returns the same output format — a plain text string of advice.

